# FillWords — Core Rules

## Goals

- Keep changes small, reviewable, and testable.
- Separate puzzle logic (`domain/`) from UI (`features/`).

## TypeScript

- Use strict TypeScript; prefer `unknown` over `any`.
- Export types intentionally from domain modules.

## React

- Function components and hooks only.
- Derive state where possible; avoid duplicating puzzle state in UI.

## Testing

- Unit-test pure puzzle logic in `domain/`.
- Prefer behavior tests over implementation details.

## Git

- Meaningful commit messages explaining why.
